+ * 备忘录. A shut eye keeps enough of its length to read as a short bar, as the reference's lids do.
+ */
+const LOOP_LID_KEEP = 0.42;
+/** How thin a shut eye's lid may get, as a share of its stroke: a closed eye is still a mark. */
+const LOOP_STROKE_KEEP = 0.55;
